      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-12T20:51:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All of his creations have something special to him, but I guess my favorite will always be Spider-Man. Of course, I have a deep love of all the original founding members of the Avengers(Iron Man, Thor, Hulk, Ant-Man and the Wasp), but I have a special spot in my heart for the Star-Spangled Sentinel of Liberty himself, Captain America.</p>\n<p>Damnit. It's like I just lost my favorite grand-uncle...</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:30.384Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
