      "raw": "<p>All of his creations have something special to him, but I guess my favorite will always be Spider-Man. Of course, I have a deep love of all the original founding members of the Avengers(Iron Man, Thor, Hulk, Ant-Man and the Wasp), but I have a special spot in my heart for the Star-Spangled Sentinel of Liberty himself, Captain America.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Damnit. It's like I just lost my favorite grand-uncle...</p>",
